[Opponent "6.Bf4"]
[Start "1. e4 c6 2. d4 d5 3. exd5 cxd5 4. Bd3 Nc6 5. c3 Qc7"]

6. Bf4 $2 { White's bishop attacks the queen, but nothing protects the bishop. } 6... Qxf4 { The queen takes a free bishop. White cannot take back, because the bishop on d3 does not guard f4. } *
